{"id":13432132610,"name":"Square Incremental (BETA)","desc":"Welcome to Square Incremental! In this game you find yourself in a dark place with just a Block which you have to push to the Squares on the floor to start gaining Squares.\n\nThis is an Incremental game, meaning you will have to sacrifice a lot of Currencies to get further!\n\nThis game is still in BETA so expect bugs.\nFor the Update log check out the Update log board ingame.\n\nAlso don't expect an update every 2 days I am literally developing this alone :/\n\nCredit: \nInspired UI by \"The Cubixion\" (made by @TroxiDev)\nInspired Resets by \"Grass Cutting Incremental\" (made by @LethalDolphin)\n\n@TheSimulanator (me) for making everything ^_^","path":"/game/13432132610-square-incremental","slug":"13432132610-square-incremental","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/afec7151a5dabb39558e07a00861f24b4d8821b3a2047709adf94c3657e053fb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-061b91ef3c9025a57090d811fca38a7f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":83120,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-09-04T01:23:32.907Z","creator":{"name":"Cubework Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"64f531947f08595d513ec16c","title":"Auto","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7814e","gameId":13432132610,"name":"Square Incremental (BETA)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"13432132610-square-incremental","path":"/game/13432132610-square-incremental","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":13432132610},"slug":"Square-Incremental-(BETA)-Auto-7586","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":119465,"executes":27,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/effc835ea23fea9c2381aaa8f15a7d2496192f3edb3d22cef29bd3436bfac0b5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/13432132610-1693790612819.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/13432132610-1693790612819.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/effc835ea23fea9c2381aaa8f15a7d2496192f3edb3d22cef29bd3436bfac0b5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/13432132610-1693790612819.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/13432132610-1693790612819.webp"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2023-09-04T01:23:32.907Z","updatedAt":"2023-09-04T01:23:32.907Z","lastBump":"2023-09-04T01:23:32.907Z","script":"getgenv().AutoUpgrade = true -- turn off if issues\n\n-- tiny little anticheat bypass tomato.txt and auto collect squares\ngetgenv()[\"tomato.txt_anticheatbypassandmore\"] = function()\n\tlocal function RemoveAntiCheat(Character)\n\t\tlocal AnticheatProtectScript = Character:WaitForChild(\"Anti\", 5)\n\t\tif not AnticheatProtectScript then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\tlocal AnticheatScript = Character:WaitForChild(\"JyAntiCheat.lua\")\n\t\tAnticheatProtectScript.Disabled = true\n\t\tAnticheatScript.Disabled = true\n\t\tAnticheatProtectScript:Destroy()\n\t\tAnticheatScript:Destroy()\n\tend\n\tlocal LocalPlayer = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\n\tRemoveAntiCheat(LocalPlayer.Character)\n\tLocalPlayer.Character.HumanoidRootPart.Velocity = Vector3.new(-100, 0, 0)\n\tlocal playercube = workspace.PlayerCube:WaitForChild(LocalPlayer.Name)\n\twhile task.wait() do\n\t\tfor i, Area in pairs(workspace.Areas:GetChildren()) do\n\t\t\tplayercube.CFrame = Area.CFrame\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\ntask.spawn(getgenv()[\"tomato.txt_anticheatbypassandmore\"])\n\nif not getgenv().AutoUpgrade then error(\"Auto Upgrade off thats why this error has appeared its Okay tho :)\") end\n\n-- semi smart auto upgrade 55% efficency\nlocal RemoteEvents = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"RemoteEvents\")\nlocal BuyMax = RemoteEvents:WaitForChild(\"BuyMax\")\nlocal BuyOne = RemoteEvents:WaitForChild(\"BuyOne\")\nlocal PrestigeReset = RemoteEvents:WaitForChild(\"PrestigeReset\")\nlocal RubyReset = RemoteEvents:WaitForChild(\"RubyReset\")\nlocal LightResetCheck = RemoteEvents:WaitForChild(\"LightResetCheck\")\n\n\nwhile task.wait(0.1 - 0.015) do\n\t-- Square and Golden Square upgrades\n\tlocal SU_GSU = {\"SU1B\", \"SU2B\", \"SU3B\", \"GSU1B\", \"GSU2B\"}\n\tfor i,v in pairs(SU_GSU) do\n\t\tBuyMax:FireServer(v)\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\t\tPrestigeReset:FireServer()\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\tend\n\n\t-- Prestige Upgrades\n\tlocal PU = {\"PU1B\", \"PU2B\"}\n\tfor i,v in pairs(PU) do\n\t\tBuyMax:FireServer(v)\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\t\tRubyReset:FireServer()\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\tend\n\n\t--Third Prestige Upgrade IE uses diffrent remote\n\tBuyOne:FireServer(\"PU3B\")\n\ttask.wait()\n\tRubyReset:FireServer()\n\ttask.wait()\n\t-- Ruby Upgrades\n\tlocal RU = {\"RU1B\", \"RU2B\", \"RU3B\"}\n\tfor i,v in pairs(RU) do\n\t\tBuyMax:FireServer(v)\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\t\tLightResetCheck:FireServer()\n\t\ttask.wait()\n\tend\nend","features":"Auto Collect Squares\n\nToggleable Auto Upgrade/Auto Prestige which includes:\nAll Square Upgrades\nAll Golden Square Upgrades\nAuto Prestige\nAll Pretige Upgrades\nAuto Ruby\nAll Ruby Upgrades\nAuto Light (Full Reset + Benefits)","tags":["auto","prestige","hub","toggle","NoGui"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8-1714691274203.png"},"lvl":23,"status":"offline","id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":5,"period":"all","metric":"views","value":11038528}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":10000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6